<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>EC23C14 · Digital VLSI Design · Exam Prediction 2026</title>
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap');

  :root {
    --bg:       #070b12;
    --card:     #0c1220;
    --card2:    #111827;
    --border:   #1e2d45;
    --border2:  #253555;
    --text:     #e8f0fe;
    --muted:    #6b7fa3;
    --u1:       #00c8ff;   /* Unit I  – cyan */
    --u2:       #00e5a0;   /* Unit II – green */
    --u3:       #fbbf24;   /* Unit III– amber */
    --u4:       #f97316;   /* Unit IV – orange */
    --u5:       #c084fc;   /* Unit V  – violet */
    --danger:   #f43f5e;
    --success:  #22d3ee;
    --warn:     #facc15;
    --glow1: 0 0 18px rgba(0,200,255,.18);
    --glow2: 0 0 18px rgba(0,229,160,.18);
    --glow3: 0 0 18px rgba(251,191,36,.18);
    --glow4: 0 0 18px rgba(249,115,22,.18);
    --glow5: 0 0 18px rgba(192,132,252,.18);
  }

  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  body {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 0 0 60px;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 10%, rgba(0,200,255,.04) 0%, transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 85%, rgba(192,132,252,.04) 0%, transparent 55%);
  }

  /* ─── HEADER ─────────────────────────────────── */
  header {
    position: relative;
    padding: 36px 32px 28px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  header::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0,200,255,.06) 0%, transparent 60%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .header-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: .15em;
    color: var(--u1);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  header h1 {
    font-size: clamp(22px, 4vw, 36px);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -.02em;
  }
  header h1 span { color: var(--u1); }
  .header-meta {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 18px;
  }
  .header-badge {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
    background: rgba(0,200,255,.08); border: 1px solid rgba(0,200,255,.25);
    border-radius: 20px; padding: 4px 12px;
    font-size: 11px; color: var(--u1); font-weight: 600;
  }
  .confidence-strip {
    position: absolute; top: 20px; right: 32px;
    text-align: right;
  }
  .conf-ring {
    width: 72px; height: 72px;
    position: relative; margin-left: auto;
  }
  .conf-ring svg { transform: rotate(-90deg); }
  .conf-ring .track { fill: none; stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 6; }
  .conf-ring .fill  { fill: none; stroke: var(--u1); stroke-width: 6;
    stroke-dasharray: 188.5; stroke-dashoffset: 28.3;
    stroke-linecap: round; }
  .conf-label {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }
  .conf-label .num { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--u1); line-height: 1; }
  .conf-label .sub { font-size: 9px; color: var(--muted); font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }
  .conf-caption { font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px; }

  /* ─── STATS BAR ──────────────────────────────── */
  .stats-bar {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(130px, 1fr));
    gap: 1px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--border);
  }
  .stat-cell {
    background: var(--card);
    padding: 16px 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .stat-cell .sv { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1; color: var(--text); }
  .stat-cell .sl { font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 3px;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; }

  /* ─── STRATEGY PANEL ─────────────────────────── */
  .strategy {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .strat-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
  }
  .strat-card .sc-head {
    font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .12em;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .strat-card ul { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; }
  .strat-card ul li {
    font-size: 12.5px; color: #c5d3eb; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 7px;
  }
  .strat-card ul li::before { content: '→'; color: var(--muted); flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px; }

  /* ─── UNIT TABS ───────────────────────────────── */
  .tabs-wrap { padding: 20px 24px 0; }
  .tab-nav {
    display: flex; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }
  .tab-btn {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 10px 18px;
    border: none; border-bottom: 3px solid transparent;
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--muted);
    cursor: pointer;
    border-radius: 6px 6px 0 0;
    transition: all .2s;
    white-space: nowrap;
    letter-spacing: .04em;
  }
  .tab-btn:hover { color: var(--text); background: rgba(255,255,255,.04); }
  .tab-btn.active { color: var(--text); border-bottom-color: var(--uc); background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); }

  /* ─── TAB CONTENT ─────────────────────────────── */
  .tab-panels { padding: 24px 24px 0; }
  .tab-panel { display: none; }
  .tab-panel.active { display: block; }

  /* Unit header */
  .unit-header {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .unit-chip {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    padding: 6px 16px;
    border-radius: 30px;
    border: 1px solid;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .06em;
  }
  .unit-title { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; }
  .unit-subtitle { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 2px; }

  /* ─── TOPICS GRID ─────────────────────────────── */
  .topics-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(340px, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .topic-card {
    background: var(--card2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--uc);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 16px;
    transition: box-shadow .25s;
  }
  .topic-card:hover { box-shadow: var(--glow); }

  .tc-top {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .tc-name {
    font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.35;
    flex: 1; padding-right: 10px;
  }
  .tc-prob {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--uc);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* Probability bar */
  .prob-bar-wrap { margin: 8px 0 12px; }
  .prob-bar-bg {
    height: 6px; background: var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .prob-bar-fill {
    height: 100%; border-radius: 3px;
    background: var(--uc);
    transition: width 1s cubic-bezier(.17,.67,.35,1.2);
  }

  /* Meta chips */
  .tc-meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .meta-chip {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid;
    letter-spacing: .04em;
  }
  .chip-easy   { color: #4ade80; border-color: rgba(74,222,128,.35); background: rgba(74,222,128,.08); }
  .chip-medium { color: #fbbf24; border-color: rgba(251,191,36,.35); background: rgba(251,191,36,.08); }
  .chip-hard   { color: #f87171; border-color: rgba(248,113,113,.35); background: rgba(248,113,113,.08); }
  .chip-type   { color: #94a3b8; border-color: rgba(148,163,184,.25); background: rgba(148,163,184,.06); }
  .chip-time   { color: #c084fc; border-color: rgba(192,132,252,.3);  background: rgba(192,132,252,.06); }
  .chip-hot    { color: #f97316; border-color: rgba(249,115,22,.4);   background: rgba(249,115,22,.1); }

  .tc-reason {
    font-size: 12px; color: #8899bb; line-height: 1.55;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: 9px; margin-top: 2px;
  }

  /* ─── QUESTIONS SECTION ───────────────────────── */
  .questions-section { margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .qs-head {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .qs-badge {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
  }
  .qs-badge.b16 { background: rgba(0,200,255,.12); color: var(--u1); border: 1px solid rgba(0,200,255,.3); }
  .qs-badge.b8  { background: rgba(0,229,160,.10); color: var(--u2); border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,160,.3); }
  .qs-badge.b13 { background: rgba(251,191,36,.10); color: var(--u3); border: 1px solid rgba(251,191,36,.3); }
  .qs-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }

  .q-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .q-item {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .q-rank {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700;
    min-width: 28px; height: 28px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 50%; border: 1.5px solid;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .rank-1 { border-color: #fbbf24; color: #fbbf24; background: rgba(251,191,36,.1); }
  .rank-2 { border-color: #94a3b8; color: #94a3b8; background: rgba(148,163,184,.08); }
  .rank-3 { border-color: #cd7f32; color: #cd7f32; background: rgba(205,127,50,.08); }
  .rank-n { border-color: var(--border2); color: var(--muted); }

  .q-text { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #ccd8f0; flex: 1; }
  .q-tag {
    font-size: 10px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px;
  }

  /* ─── PRIORITY GRID ───────────────────────────── */
  .priority-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .priority-box {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
  }
  .pb-head {
    font-size: 11px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .1em;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;
  }
  .dot-hi  { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #22d3ee; box-shadow: 0 0 6px #22d3ee; }
  .dot-lo  { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--muted); }
  .priority-list { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; }
  .priority-list li {
    font-size: 12.5px; color: #aab8d4;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  }
  .priority-list li .pl-icon { font-size: 13px; }

  /* ─── FOOTER STRATEGY ─────────────────────────── */
  .final-strategy {
    margin: 28px 24px 0;
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .fs-head {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,200,255,.08), transparent);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 16px 20px;
    font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -.01em;
  }
  .fs-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
    gap: 0;
  }
  .fs-cell {
    padding: 18px 20px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .fs-cell:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .fs-label {
    font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .12em;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .fs-items { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; }
  .fs-item {
    font-size: 12.5px; color: #c5d3eb;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;
  }
  .fs-item::before { content: '◆'; font-size: 7px; color: var(--u1); }

  /* Scrollable table */
  .overflow-x { overflow-x: auto; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 12.5px; }
  thead th {
    background: var(--card);
    color: var(--muted); font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em;
    padding: 10px 14px; text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  tbody tr { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); transition: background .15s; }
  tbody tr:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.03); }
  tbody td { padding: 10px 14px; color: #c5d3eb; vertical-align: middle; }
  .tbl-unit { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; }
  .tbl-prob { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-weight: 700; }

  /* Divider */
  .divider {
    height: 1px; background: var(--border);
    margin: 20px 0;
  }

  /* Tags inline */
  .tag {
    display: inline-flex; padding: 1px 7px;
    border-radius: 8px; font-size: 10px;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    margin-left: 6px;
  }
  .tag-rep { background: rgba(249,115,22,.15); color: #f97316; border: 1px solid rgba(249,115,22,.3); }
  .tag-new { background: rgba(34,211,238,.12); color: #22d3ee; border: 1px solid rgba(34,211,238,.3); }
  .tag-num { background: rgba(192,132,252,.12); color: #c084fc; border: 1px solid rgba(192,132,252,.3); }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .priority-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .topics-grid  { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .confidence-strip { position: static; margin-top: 16px; text-align: left; }
    .confidence-strip .conf-ring { margin: 0; }
    header { padding: 24px 16px 20px; }
    .stats-bar { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
    .strategy, .tabs-wrap, .tab-panels, .final-strategy { padding-left: 14px; padding-right: 14px; }
  }

  /* Fade-in animation */
  .tab-panel.active { animation: fadeIn .3s ease; }
  @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }

  /* Scrollbar */
  ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; height: 6px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--bg); }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--border2); border-radius: 3px; }

  /* NOTE BOX */
  .note-box {
    display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start;
    background: rgba(251,191,36,.06); border: 1px solid rgba(251,191,36,.25);
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 20px;
    font-size: 12.5px; color: #e2c970; line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .note-box .ni { flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 1px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ═══ HEADER ═══════════════════════════════════════ -->
<header>
  <div class="header-eyebrow">Anna University · CEG Campus · VI Semester · R-2023</div>
  <h1>EC23C14 · <span>Digital VLSI Design</span><br>End-Semester Exam Prediction</h1>
  <div class="header-meta">
    <span>📄 4 papers analysed</span>
    <span>📅 Dec 2025 – May 2026</span>
    <span>🎯 Pattern: Assessment I + II + Retest + End-Sem</span>
    <div class="header-badge">🔥 High Confidence Predictions</div>
  </div>
  <div class="confidence-strip">
    <div class="conf-ring">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 60 60" width="72" height="72">
        <circle class="track" cx="30" cy="30" r="26"/>
        <circle class="fill"  cx="30" cy="30" r="26"/>
      </svg>
      <div class="conf-label">
        <span class="num">85</span>
        <span class="sub">%</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="conf-caption" style="color:var(--muted);font-size:10px;text-align:center;margin-top:4px;">Confidence</div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ═══ STATS BAR ════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="stats-bar">
  <div class="stat-cell"><div class="sv">5</div><div class="sl">Units</div></div>
  <div class="stat-cell"><div class="sv" style="color:var(--danger)">12</div><div class="sl">🔥 Hot Topics</div></div>
  <div class="stat-cell"><div class="sv" style="color:var(--u2)">100</div><div class="sl">Total Marks</div></div>
  <div class="stat-cell"><div class="sv" style="color:var(--u3)">4</div><div class="sl">Papers Analysed</div></div>
  <div class="stat-cell"><div class="sv" style="color:var(--u5)">~30h</div><div class="sl">Smart Prep</div></div>
</div>

<!-- ═══ STRATEGY PANEL ════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="strategy">
  <div class="strat-card">
    <div class="sc-head" style="color:var(--u1)">🎯 20% → 80% Topics</div>
    <ul>
      <li>CMOS Inverter VTC + VM + Noise Margin</li>
      <li>Pseudo-NMOS sizing (Wp/Wn)</li>
      <li>Dynamic Logic + Power calculations</li>
      <li>6T SRAM read/write + 1T DRAM</li>
      <li>Master-slave TG register + timing</li>
      <li>Carry Bypass Adder (16/20-bit)</li>
      <li>FPGA (LUT, Xilinx-4000, ASIC flow)</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="strat-card">
    <div class="sc-head" style="color:var(--u2)">⚡ Fastest Units (Time ROI)</div>
    <ul>
      <li><b>Unit V</b> – mostly theory, 1 day</li>
      <li><b>Unit IV</b> – 3 formula types, 1.5 days</li>
      <li><b>Unit I</b> – foundational, 2 days</li>
      <li><b>Unit II</b> – broadest, 3 days</li>
      <li><b>Unit III</b> – mix of both, 2 days</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="strat-card">
    <div class="sc-head" style="color:var(--u3)">✅ Safest Scoring Topics</div>
    <ul>
      <li>VTC derivation (appeared in every paper)</li>
      <li>Wp/Wn pseudo-NMOS (Retest + End Sem)</li>
      <li>Dynamic power formula (≥3 papers)</li>
      <li>6T SRAM read/write operation</li>
      <li>ASIC design flow (theory – easy marks)</li>
      <li>Domino logic – 2-input AND/OR design</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="strat-card">
    <div class="sc-head" style="color:var(--danger)">⚠️ Hardest Topics (Attempt Carefully)</div>
    <ul>
      <li>Logical Effort gate sizing (Part C End-Sem)</li>
      <li>4×4 Array Multiplier critical path</li>
      <li>Sq-root carry select adder derivation</li>
      <li>Elmore's delay constant for complex nets</li>
      <li>C²MOS clock overlap immunity analysis</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ═══ UNIT TABS ════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="tabs-wrap">
  <div class="tab-nav">
    <button class="tab-btn active" style="--uc:var(--u1)" onclick="showTab('u1',this)">UNIT I · MOS Fundamentals</button>
    <button class="tab-btn"        style="--uc:var(--u2)" onclick="showTab('u2',this)">UNIT II · Combinational</button>
    <button class="tab-btn"        style="--uc:var(--u3)" onclick="showTab('u3',this)">UNIT III · Sequential</button>
    <button class="tab-btn"        style="--uc:var(--u4)" onclick="showTab('u4',this)">UNIT IV · Arithmetic</button>
    <button class="tab-btn"        style="--uc:var(--u5)" onclick="showTab('u5',this)">UNIT V · Implementation</button>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="tab-panels">

<!-- ═══ UNIT I ════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="tab-panel active" id="u1">
  <div class="unit-header">
    <div class="unit-chip" style="--uc:var(--u1);color:var(--u1);border-color:rgba(0,200,255,.4);background:rgba(0,200,255,.07)">
      ◉ UNIT I
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="unit-title">MOS Transistor Principles</div>
      <div class="unit-subtitle">Operating modes · CMOS Inverter · Scaling · Propagation Delay · Elmore's</div>
    </div>
  </div>

